    <task id="Id_b385afa2-4118-4b3e-9b60-deaebaadcb77" name="6.1 Preparar o Edital">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 18. A fase preparat&amp;oacute;ria do processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio &amp;eacute; caracterizada pelo planejamento e deve compatibilizar-secom o plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual de que trata o inciso VII do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;do art. 12 desta Lei, sempre que elaborado, ecom as leis or&amp;ccedil;ament&amp;aacute;rias, bem como abordar todas as considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es t&amp;eacute;cnicas, mercadol&amp;oacute;gicas e de gest&amp;atilde;o quepodem interferir na contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, compreendidos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;V - a elabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do edital de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;O QUE E?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;Eacute; a &amp;ldquo;lei&amp;rdquo; da licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, traz as regras regentes do certame e deve refletir as escolhas do gestor feitas durante o planejamento da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
