    </task>
    <task id="Id_9d47e81f-88e0-49db-b22b-535ec269415a" name="5.2.3 Estabelecer requisitos e critérios de avaliação">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratante determina os requisitos m&amp;iacute;nimos que a poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante deve atender e comunicar em sua resposta &amp;agrave; proposta. Ao&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;mesmo tempo, estabelece como avaliar&amp;aacute; a efic&amp;aacute;cia com que esses requisitos m&amp;iacute;nimos s&amp;atilde;o abordados nas respostas &amp;agrave;s propostas recebidas. Isso fornece &amp;agrave; poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante um grau de orienta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o sobre o que ela deve detalhar em sua resposta &amp;agrave; proposta e permite uma avalia&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o consistente e justa das propostas recebidas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;Eacute; prov&amp;aacute;vel que as principais considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es sejam:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1) O plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM detalha suficientemente a estrat&amp;eacute;gia de federa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o proposta pela equipe de entrega, &amp;eacute; vi&amp;aacute;vel e pr&amp;aacute;tico?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2) A compet&amp;ecirc;ncia, a capacidade e a habilidade da poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante para atender aos requisitos de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3) Como a equipe de entrega do projeto ser&amp;aacute; mobilizada, pensando em obter recursos e tecnologia prontos para serem implantados. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4) A considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da licitante sobre a gest&amp;atilde;o de risco associado a entrega da infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
